<title>POLAND: BETON STAL SWINGS TO PROFIT IN NOVEMBER.</title>
<headline>BETON STAL SWINGS TO PROFIT IN NOVEMBER.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.05 vs   0.02 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.11 vs   0.02 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.17 vs   0.07 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    4.02 vs   1.37</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.47 vs   0.04</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.58 vs   0.05</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.91 vs   0.15</p>
<p> Sales		   20.60 vs   8.66</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction firm is Beton Stal</p>
<p>SA. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
